# Promotion: Chief Sergeant's reply kinds at Hagakoff (his script: the shop dialog, a message). The lookup gives the
# script a turn after an Event or a lower reply (interaction_lookup.lua's UseFallback var), not after a Progress one:
# so a Progress line talked to again right after it plays again, an Event there gives his shop. A level 1 Warrior
# accepted at Prog 0 by GMs: Hagakoff 5067, finished: Prog 1; Prog 0 again (a GM): 5067 again. Prog 2 (a GM): 5063,
# finished: Prog 3; Prog 2 again (a GM): 5063 again.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Hagakoff/onTrigger
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=37.024,-6.601,-62 job=WAR lvl=1
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionPrivateFirstClass completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionSuperiorPrivate completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionLanceCorporal completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionCorporal completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionSergeant completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionSergeantMajor completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionChiefSergeant accepted
login
trigger Hagakoff                        # Prog 0: 5067
finish                                  # Prog 1
charvar Quest[6][96]Prog 0              # a GM
trigger Hagakoff                        # 5067 again (after a Progress: no script turn)
finish                                  # Prog 1
charvar Quest[6][96]Prog 2              # a GM
trigger Hagakoff                        # Prog 2: 5063
finish                                  # Prog 3
charvar Quest[6][96]Prog 2              # a GM
trigger Hagakoff                        # 5063 again
finish                                  # Prog 3
